'' A UDT AS A FOR BOUND OR STEP runs its numeric cast, the one the counter's kind meets. tiko
'' lowered the UDT itself: 'for i = a to a + 1' started at 0. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/for-udt-bounds.bas -o tests/codegen/forudtbounds.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/forudtbounds.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l][l] 3 4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d][l] 3.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l] 1 4 7
